This crate rebuilds the NVSE plugin of The Mod Configuration Menu (MCM) 1.5 by Pelinor
(NVSE\Plugins\MCM.dll, "MCM Extensions" version 1) in Rust. The DLL ships without source; its behaviour was read from its machine code. No byte
of the DLL and no file of the mod is included.

Credits: The Mod Configuration Menu is written by Pelinor (https://www.nexusmods.com/newvegas/mods/42507).
